  "en": "Read and write contracts and scopes of work in English as a professional freelancer: understand a contract’s structure and fixed words (shall, may, must), write a clear scope with acceptance criteria and assumptions, understand payment and termination clauses, and know what risk clauses mean (liability, confidentiality, ownership) — and when you need a lawyer."
