      "en": "A contract is not «take it or leave it». You can ask for changes: a **redline** = a version showing the edits (Track Changes), and a **counter-proposal** = an alternative suggestion. Any change after signing = a written, signed **amendment**. And importantly: **this is not legal advice** — big contracts go to a lawyer."
