   "d": 4,
   "title": {
    "ar": "الفلوس والمدة والإنهاء",
    "en": "Money, term and termination"
   },
   "goal": {
    "ar": "بنود الدفع والإنهاء متفهومة ومحمية.",
    "en": "Payment and termination clauses understood and protected."
   },
   "learn": [
    {
     "h": {
      "ar": "الدفع",
      "en": "Payment"
     },
     "p": {
      "ar": "**payment terms** بتقول إمتى وإزاي: **deposit** (مقدم قبل البدء)، دفعات على مراحل، **net 30** (خلال 30 يوم من الفاتورة)، العملة، طريقة الدفع، و**late fee** (رسوم التأخير) أو حق إيقاف الشغل. اكتبها بأرقام واضحة.",
      "en": "**payment terms** say when and how: a **deposit** (paid before starting), staged payments, **net 30** (within 30 days of the invoice), the currency, the method, and a **late fee** or the right to pause work. Write them with clear numbers."
     },
     "ex": "\"Fees: EGP 24,000, payable as follows:\n(a) 40% deposit on signing;\n(b) 40% on acceptance in the staging environment;\n(c) 20% on go-live.\nInvoices are payable net 30. Late payments incur a fee of 2% per month. If an invoice is more than 15 days overdue, the Provider may pause work after giving written notice.\""
    },
    {
     "h": {
      "ar": "المدة والإنهاء",
      "en": "Term and termination"
     },
     "p": {
      "ar": "**termination** = إنهاء العقد: بإشعار (**notice period** — مثلًا 30 يوم من غير سبب)، أو فورًا لسبب (مخالفة جسيمة مش اتصلحت). ومهم: إيه يحصل بعد الإنهاء — الدفع عن الشغل اللي اتعمل، تسليم الملفات، ومسح البيانات.",
      "en": "**termination** = ending the contract: with notice (a **notice period** — e.g. 30 days without cause), or immediately for cause (a serious breach not fixed). And importantly: what happens after — payment for work done, handover of files, and deleting data."
     },
     "ex": "\"Either party may terminate this Agreement:\n(a) for any reason, by giving 30 days’ written notice; or\n(b) immediately by written notice if the other party commits a material breach and fails to remedy it within 14 days of being asked to do so.\nOn termination, the Client will pay for all work performed up to the termination date, and the Provider will hand over all Deliverables and delete Client data within 30 days.\""
    },
    {
     "h": {
      "ar": "التفاوض على الشروط",
      "en": "Negotiating terms"
     },
     "p": {
      "ar": "عملاء كبار ممكن يطلبوا net 60 أو 90. اقترح بدايل بأدب: «We’d be happy to accept net 60 with a 30% deposit» أو «Could we agree net 30 for the first project?». ولو التأخير ممكن يأثر عليك: اربط الدفعات بالمراحل مش بنهاية المشروع.",
      "en": "Big clients may ask for net 60 or 90. Suggest alternatives politely: «We’d be happy to accept net 60 with a 30% deposit» or «Could we agree net 30 for the first project?». And if delays would hurt you: tie payments to milestones, not the end of the project."
     },
     "ex": "\"Thanks for the draft. On payment terms, net 90 is quite long for a small studio like ours. Would you be open to net 45, or net 60 with a 30% deposit on signing? That would let us start immediately.\""
    }
   ],
